WEBVTT

00:06:59.476 --> 00:07:02.577
Now, these results
are statistically significant,

00:07:02.601 --> 00:07:06.072
so you can take it as scientific fact
that males are lazy.

00:07:06.096 --> 00:07:09.252
(Laughter)

00:07:09.276 --> 00:07:11.812
We can move from questions
about demography

00:07:11.836 --> 00:07:14.749
and ask questions about human health.

00:07:14.773 --> 00:07:16.260
For example, we can ask

00:07:16.284 --> 00:07:21.247
to what extent genetic variations
account for differences in life span

00:07:21.271 --> 00:07:22.465
between individuals.

00:07:22.988 --> 00:07:27.518
Previous studies analyzed the correlation
of longevity between twins

00:07:27.542 --> 00:07:28.984
to address this question.

00:07:29.411 --> 00:07:32.078
They estimated that the genetic
variations account for